guidebook.section.deep.mob.elder.skeleton.name=Elder Skeleton
guidebook.section.deep.mob.elder.skeleton.desc=A more agile and accurate variant of the regular skeleton. Wears a robe and a pair of leather boots.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.cave.creeper.name=Deeper
guidebook.section.deep.mob.cave.creeper.desc=A more aggressive creeper that has adapted to it's natural habitat with it's durable stone covered body.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.werewolf.name=Werewolf
guidebook.section.deep.mob.werewolf.desc=A zombie that has been bit by a werewolf and now packs a punch at the cost of being weaker. Watch your back!
guidebook.section.deep.mob.jellyfish.name=Jellyfish
guidebook.section.deep.mob.jellyfish.desc=jellyfish are a source of gel, a bouncy material that can be turned into slime. They can be found in lakes and oceans at night.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.shade.name=Shade
guidebook.section.deep.mob.shade.desc=Shades are apparitions with great speed at the cost of their weak physical form.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.slime.red.name=Raging Slime
guidebook.section.deep.mob.slime.red.desc=Raging slimes are similar to common slimes however much more aggressive.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.slime.water.name=Water Slime
guidebook.section.deep.mob.slime.water.desc=Water slimes instead of jumping slide around with their wet bodies. This makes them much better on flatter terrain at the cost of them performing worse on rougher terrain.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.slime.volatile.name=Volatile Slime
guidebook.section.deep.mob.slime.volatile.desc=Volatile slimes are slimes that have absorbed explosives.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.zombie.noteblock.name=Note Block Zombie
guidebook.section.deep.mob.zombie.noteblock.desc=A zombie holding a note block capable of summoning other zombies as backup.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.zombie.piston.name=Piston Block Zombie
guidebook.section.deep.mob.zombie.piston.desc=A zombie holding a piston capable of jumping to extreme heights and lunges when attacked.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.wisp.name=Wisp
guidebook.section.deep.mob.wisp.desc=Wisps are flying enemies that charge at you and set you on fire on contact. They are found in the Nether.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.popper.name=Popper
guidebook.section.deep.mob.popper.desc=A deadly netherrack abomination capable of exploding an indefinite number of times. They are found in the Nether.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.beetle.name=Beetle
guidebook.section.deep.mob.beetle.desc=Beetles are large bugs with a tough shell that appear underground in darkness.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.spider.mother.name=Mother Spider
guidebook.section.deep.mob.spider.mother.desc=Mother Spiders are large spiders that are capable of spawning their children as backup.
guidebook.section.deep.mob.zombie.outback.name=Outback Zombie
guidebook.section.deep.mob.zombie.outback.desc=Outback Zombies are a kind of zombie that appear only in the warmest places of the world. They have adapted to their extremely hot environment becoming immune to the sun's heat. Legend says these zombies even ride cows.

